,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":39.93111971,"data":"## Limits\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":39.931124186,"data":"- Passage and donor are observations; every score is inference. Growth-arrest status exists only per donor at final passage, and D and E are censored at passage 10.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":39.931128759,"data":"- Published weights were fit with BMMSC in the data. The refit no_BMMSC and no_BMMSC_prAD rows are the cell-type-independent versions.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":39.931133159,"data":"- hUSI training metadata lists 9 rows from GSE178514, so hUSI on GSE178514 is NOT an independent test. It lists 0 rows from GSE309666 and 0 from GSE284666, and 54 MSC-related rows overall.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":39.931139602,"data":"- GSE178514 is FPKM and its donor mapping is inferred. Culture systems differ (platelet lysate vs FBS), and so do library types (polyA vs rRNA-depleted).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":39.931144201,"data":"- The 40 AD-MSC biomarkers came from GSE309666, so their result there is circular; GSE178514 is their only independent test here.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":39.931148845,"data":"- No conclusion on potency, immune function or clinical safety follows from these data.\n"}
